nice_view_spi: &spi0 {
    compatible = "nordic,nrf-spim";
    pinctrl-0 = <&spi0_default>;
    pinctrl-1 = <&spi0_sleep>;
    pinctrl-names = "default", "sleep";
    cs-gpios = <&pro_micro 1 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
};
```

This matches the upstream ZMK `nice_view_adapter` board overlay and is placed where ZMK/Zephyr will automatically pick it up for `nice_nano@2.0.0` builds.

