## Problem

The GitHub Actions build is failing with this error:

```
devicetree error: /tmp/zmk-config/zmk/app/boards/shields/nice_view/nice_view.overlay:7 (column 1): parse error: undefined node label 'nice_view_spi'
```

The build command that fails is:
```
